{"4383190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Intravenous 3", "steam_appid": 4383190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/7b4cecfe2486b178a7fce77b89753ffe.avif?t=1775233391\" width=1170 height=844 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE HUNT. BECOME THE HUNTER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intravenous 3 is a top-down action game about adaptation under pressure, blending deep, systemic stealth with brutal tactical gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Steve and Sean forced to survive a relentless manhunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b631181f95085ea37b7c62ab067ddb11.poster.avif?t=1775233391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b631181f95085ea37b7c62ab067ddb11.webm?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b631181f95085ea37b7c62ab067ddb11.mp4?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\t </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adaptation is the key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission can lead to a different follow-up scenario shaped by your actions, forcing you to adapt to new risks, new pressure, and new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through a mission, and you may find yourself trapped in a firefight on the way out. Stay unseen, and new opportunities will present themselves to you later in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/2e04b3b730706b00f6844c74b0e0c4a0.poster.avif?t=1775233391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/2e04b3b730706b00f6844c74b0e0c4a0.webm?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/2e04b3b730706b00f6844c74b0e0c4a0.mp4?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\t </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful builds, deep weapon customization, and tactical gear\t</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Steve and Sean around distinct abilities, then expand your options with extensive weapon modification, specialized gadgets, and equipment that lets you prepare for silent infiltration or brutal close-quarters survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b9ef70096e0cce11b5cada38f3c50499.poster.avif?t=1775233391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b9ef70096e0cce11b5cada38f3c50499.webm?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b9ef70096e0cce11b5cada38f3c50499.mp4?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smarter, deadlier enemy AI\t</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react more believably to sound and movement, investigate disturbances, coordinate in groups, guard key areas together, and force you to adapt when the situation starts to unravel.\t </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adaptive soundtrack by Xtrullor\t</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic new score shifts with stealth, firefights, and escape, intensifying every infiltration, chase, and desperate last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE HUNT. BECOME THE HUNTER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intravenous 3 is a top-down action game about adaptation under pressure, blending deep, systemic stealth with brutal tactical gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Steve and Sean forced to survive a relentless manhunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b631181f95085ea37b7c62ab067ddb11.poster.avif?t=1775233391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b631181f95085ea37b7c62ab067ddb11.webm?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/b631181f95085ea37b7c62ab067ddb11.mp4?t=1775233391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\t </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adaptation is the key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission can lead to a different follow-up scenario shaped by your actions, forcing you to adapt to new risks, new pressure, and new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through a mission, and you may find yourself trapped in a firefight on the way out. Stay unseen, and new opportunities will present themselves to you later in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383190/extras/2e04b3b730706b00f6844c74b0e0c4a0.poster.avif?t=1775233391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_